<title>USA: Fannie Mae sets about $357 mln REMIC.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets about $357 mln REMIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it issued a little over $357 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities via Bear Stearns Cos Inc.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-12 is backed by 30-year, 7.0 percent, 7.5 percent and 8.0 percent mortgage-backed securities. The issue priced on January 28 and has a settlement date of March 27, the agency said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
